{"ID":"20240515131442-ty2aot7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131442-ty2aot7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131442-ty2aot7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133228-p0g31e5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133228-p0g31e5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:474,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133228-p0g31e5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:963,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:963\u0026#125;","title":"020","type":"doc","updated":"20240515151832"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515133228-p0g31e5","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 788px;","id":"20240515133228-p0g31e5","updated":"20240515151832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：２００８／０８／２５"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"51歲，略瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/25"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1981年起有B、C型肝炎，病人無C肝抗體，之後形成肝硬化。兩年前得糖尿病，小腿水腫有六個月了。自述皮膚一碰即破→西要造成的，很多年不流汗了，且常抽筋。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.小便：深黃，近紅，量少，日間次數少，晚間頻尿而色清。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.胃口：好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.大便：每日行，有時便如黑油。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.睡眠：易入睡，因尿而醒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.手足額身：手足冷，睡時身冷，額熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.午後有潮熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.口渴：渴而不欲飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.血糖指數：飯前150-200;飯後200-300。血糖高時感到頭昏身體怪怪的，手部有少許麻，也試過日間無故昏睡，拍也不醒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.體力：好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.脇肋：非持續的脹痛或刺痛感。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.雙足麻"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：尺脈大於寸"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：臉黧黑，為主色，細看帶青、黃。胸肋間皮膚有血絲。\n1、舌診：淡白紅\n2、眼診 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong strong","TextMarkTextContent":":"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" 肝區多白點，圈紋擠得很密。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 裡寒、陰寒。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方： \n左前臂肝關（腕圓骨上６寸，從外側入針） 三皇穴 足三里 大腿內側肝病奇穴壓痛點 章門 期門\n翻身針肝俞 腎俞 脾俞"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n生附子二錢 乾薑二錢 炙甘草三錢 柴胡三錢 玉金五錢 茵陳三錢\n白朮三錢 梔子三錢 天花粉三錢 熟地三錢 澤瀉四錢 烏藥三錢\n細辛二錢 桂枝四錢 茯苓四錢 茜草三錢 炙鱟甲三錢 白芍五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.病人臉黑帶青黃，是腎、肝、脾三臟同病之證。尺脈大於寸、午後潮熱、夜尿頻，頭熱手足冷，四者共證陽不入陰。故用生附處理裡寒及陰寒，使陽能入陰。又以柴胡、玉金、茵陳、入肝舒解氣鬱；以茜草、鱉甲入肝攻血鬱。病人渴而不欲飲，是內有瘀血之證，故攻之。為防入肝之力不足，加大劑白芍使藥隨血歸肝。凡治肝硬化，必用白芍。又以熟地、澤瀉理腎。以白朮、茯苓理脾。因足冷、夜尿頻故用烏藥細辛移心熱於小腸。因心陽已傷、無汗故重用桂枝、炙甘草，但他有腿腫而炙甘草會蓄水，因此若下次來診腿仍腫則炙甘草要去之。因有虛熱於上焦故用梔子、天花。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.針術方面：當以瀉南補北為指引。因肝於右，故只針左肝關。因小腿水腫，針三皇穴及足三里。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.凡肝病當針肝病奇穴，以壓痛點下針為準。三臟同病故針臟之會穴章門，肝硬化故針肝募期門。背針三臟之俞穴則不待一二言矣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.另外病人胸前脅肋區有血絲，提示有肝癌肝硬化，反之亦然。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 他小腿腫跟打胰島素有關。若是本身疾病造成腳水腫則危險，因為男人怕腳腫。若是吃西藥造成腳水腫，一般不危險，停藥即恢復。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}